  "reasoning": "The defendant operated a shop where he accepted bets for the Hong Kong Mark Six lottery, an illegal gambling activity. He organized and facilitated the gambling by taking bets and forwarding them to co‑defendants, earning a commission. This conduct corresponds to the crime of operating an illegal gambling venue, which in Chinese criminal law is charged as “开设赌场”. No other distinct illegal acts are described.",
